{"about_the_game":"Birth of a Hunter is a metroidvania style 2D platformer, with the twist that a huge new map is generated every time you start a new game. Get ready to explore different environments with their own dungeons to power yourself up and defeat bosses, all of which are randomly generated or selected.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A brand new map with brand new rooms randomly generated for each play-through<br></li><li>A variety of randomly chosen<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Environments<br></li><li>Dungeons<br></li><li>Bosses<br></li><li>And power ups to discover each new game. No two playthroughs will be the same!</li></ul></li><li>A resource management mechanic, where you must choose whether to allocate energy to health or ammo<br></li><li>Four different unlockable difficulty levels to add extra challenges, including a roguelite mode<br></li><li>Steam achievements<br></li><li>The low price of free<br></li><li>The personal touch and weird interesting bits that you might expect from a game made as a passion project by one person</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7afe7d48f17bf336d847ee662787c428d57a2307.jpg","localized_name":"Starting the Fall","name":"Starting the Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1027480/7afe7d48f17bf336d847ee662787c428d57a2307.jpg"},{"icon":"54d6039a9315a8427deeaf69cd0506e69382a9c6.jpg","localized_name":"A Hunter is Born","name":"A Hunter is Born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1027480/54d6039a9315a8427deeaf69cd0506e69382a9c6.jpg"},{"icon":"1810feb9047831a8c0d27807e37ab789e15b7f11.jpg","localized_name":"Naked and Afraid","name":"Naked and Afraid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1027480/1810feb9047831a8c0d27807e37ab789e15b7f11.jpg"},{"icon":"3e2d35e65f38746d2c22df09849825e623995bc1.jpg","localized_name":"Is this even possible?","name":"Is this even possib